    "prompt_language": "en",
    "review_language": "zh-CN",
    "user_prompt": "I was sent this photo from inside a place at the V&A Waterfront in Cape Town, and I’m trying to pin down the exact restaurant or cafe rather than just the waterfront area. It felt like a quieter, old Pierhead Road building with an upstairs lounge or stairwell, not a food-market hall, and my friend mentioned being very close to The Waterside and Den Anker, with the cruise/tour boats around Quay 5 nearby. Could you use the photo plus those hints to work out which specific place this is?",
    "user_prompt_translation": "有人发给我这张照片，说是在开普敦 V&A Waterfront 的某个地方里面拍的，我想确定的是具体哪一家餐厅或咖啡馆，而不只是这个海滨区域。那里感觉像 Pierhead Road 上一栋比较安静的老建筑，里面有楼上的休息区或楼梯间，不像美食市场大厅；朋友还提到它离 The Waterside 和 Den Anker 很近，附近还有 Quay 5 一带的游船/旅游船。你能结合这张照片和这些线索，判断这是哪个具体地点吗？",
    "review_translation": {
      "language": "zh-CN",
      "user_prompt": "有人发给我这张照片，说是在开普敦 V&A Waterfront 的某个地方里面拍的，我想确定的是具体哪一家餐厅或咖啡馆，而不只是这个海滨区域。那里感觉像 Pierhead Road 上一栋比较安静的老建筑，里面有楼上的休息区或楼梯间，不像美食市场大厅；朋友还提到它离 The Waterside 和 Den Anker 很近，附近还有 Quay 5 一带的游船/旅游船。你能结合这张照片和这些线索，判断这是哪个具体地点吗？",
      "notes": "The translation preserves the uncertainty and does not add the gold place name."
    },
